  "description": "<p>On completion of \n    <span class=\"jira-issue-macro\" data-jira-key=\"FCREPO-3213\" >\n                <a href=\"https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/browse/FCREPO-3213\" class=\"jira-issue-macro-key issue-link\"  title=\"SHA-512 support for Fedora 5\" >\n            <img class=\"icon\" src=\"https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/universal_avatar/view/type/issuetype/avatar/10315?size=medium\" />\n            FCREPO-3213\n        </a>\n                                                    <span class=\"aui-lozenge aui-lozenge-subtle aui-lozenge-complete jira-macro-single-issue-export-pdf\">Open</span>\n            </span>\n and \n    <span class=\"jira-issue-macro\" data-jira-key=\"FCREPO-3214\" >\n                <a href=\"https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/browse/FCREPO-3214\" class=\"jira-issue-macro-key issue-link\"  title=\"Java client SHA-512 Support\" >\n            <img class=\"icon\" src=\"https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/universal_avatar/view/type/issuetype/avatar/10315?size=medium\" />\n            FCREPO-3214\n        </a>\n                                                    <span class=\"aui-lozenge aui-lozenge-subtle aui-lozenge-complete jira-macro-single-issue-export-pdf\">Open</span>\n            </span>\n, the Import Export tool should be updated in order to support using SHA-512 manifests read from BagIt Bags.</p>",
